    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "https://www.auctioneera.ie/property/28-cooline-crest-cobh-cork-p24kc59\r\nImportant note: Details of upcoming viewings and latest offers are available at the Auctioneera website link above.\r\n\r\nAuctioneera is delighted to present 28 Cooline Crest, Cobh.\r\n\r\nWelcome to this charming three-bedroom terraced home nestled in a family-friendly neighbourhood. This property sits gracefully on a well-maintained street with a neat, low-maintenance front garden and an inviting exterior showcasing traditional terraced architecture.\r\n\r\nUpon entering, you are greeted by a cosy living room featuring warm wooden flooring, ample natural light from large windows, and efficient use of space. The adjacent dining area is conveniently connected to a well-equipped kitchen, boasting modern cabinetry and integrated appliances designed for effortless meal preparation and entertaining. This floor also has a guest bathroom for added convenience. A key highlight of this property is the large, newly constructed garden room at the rear. Fully insulated and equipped with power and internet supply, this versatile space is ideal for a home office, studio, or additional living area, offering a seamless indoor-outdoor transition through sliding doors onto the charming garden patio.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, you will find three spacious bedrooms, each providing comfortable living arrangements with ample space for personalisation. The master bedroom is capaciously designed to accommodate sizable furnishings and also features an ensuite bathroom. The property further benefits from a well-proportioned main bathroom, featuring modern fittings with quality tiles for a polished finish. Clever use of under-stair storage and a spacious attic with ladder access provides excellent storage solutions throughout the home.\r\n\r\nLocated in the picturesque town of Cobh, this home is surrounded by several green recreation areas perfect for family activities. Excellent transport links with nearby bus stops and Cobh train station, within a 15-minute walk, provide easy access to Cork city centre and beyond. Local amenities include reputable schools, shopping facilities, and sports clubs, making it an ideal choice for first-time buyers or those looking to embrace a convenient lifestyle.\r\n\r\nWith its ideal location and practical features, this property is the perfect blend of comfort and functionality for any prospective homeowner."
